          <td>Capture, and any platform fee</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">Unlimited-request subscription</th>
          <td>A month of access</td>
          <td>Capture, talent and usage</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">Managed subscription</th>
          <td>A month above a stated floor</td>
          <td>Anything the card leaves out of the month's scope</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">Binding proposal</th>
          <td>The deliverables it names</td>
          <td>Whatever its exclusions list says</td>
        </tr>
